# sshcast topic registry: <host> <topic> <remote-command...>
# Copy to ~/.config/sshcast/topics and edit. <host> is any ssh host alias
# (from ~/.ssh/config) or user@hostname. The remote command must print
# newline-delimited JSON to stdout and ideally accept --since <id>.

# jump heartbeat   .sshcast-watchers/heartbeat --interval 5
# jump sysjournal  .sshcast-watchers/sysjournal
# jump deploylog   .sshcast-watchers/filewatch /var/log/deploy.log
